      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For me it feels like more deep hang, that in 2017-version. In 2107 it's \"crashing\" by self after some delay on exit, or if it hangs, I was able to click the cross on window and it was closing anyways. In 2018 it hangs ALWAYS on exit, sometimes it hangs in some strange way, so \"this program does not respond\" dialog from windows system does not always triggered and it's hard to close the app manually. only taskmanager helps. It's rly annoying from VR, also because privileged processes as taskmanager can't be controlled from Steam dash.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
