      "statusChangeID": "610d9a41c2bb9327da003a07",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "open",
      "value": "Still happens really rarely, usually due to hanging on to some file handle somewhere. We've fixed most causes of this, but not all.\nMoving back to Open, as this isn't really *actively* being worked on, but instead it is a symptom of several individual problems that are being worked on as we find them.",
