      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I haven't used VRC for ages, though I've had problems with other games hanging or Steam not recognizing their closure. I've found that stopping Steam's background processes stops this in those circumstances, allowing the game to be launched again. I'm not sure if the same procedure works in the event the problem is caused by EAC though.",
